<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερύω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερῡκ-ειρύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw, haul down</i>, freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> of ships, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήν γε [σχεδίην] κατείρυσεν εἰς ἅλα
					δῖαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.261
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηῦς τε κατείρυσται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.151
				</span></i>
			, etc.; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατειρύσαντες ἐς Σαλαμῖνα τὰ ναυήγια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.96
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. οὔθατα μόσχου</span>
			<i>to draw</i> or <i>milk</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				552
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξα κ.</span>
			<i>draw</i> a bow, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.16
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>):—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κὰδ δ᾽ ἄρα λαῖφος
				ἐρυσσάμενοι</span>
			<i>unfurling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.931
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
